00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:45.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
The others worked, I swear,
but this one did, too.

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:47.680 line:95% align:center position:50%
That's so you can give feedback. Okay?

00:23:47.800 --> 00:23:49.680 line:95% align:center position:50%
Thank you in advance, and thank you all.

